WEBVTT

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:10.000
Hey, Takagi-san.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.420
Can I interest you in taking
a little side trip on the way home?

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:14.880
Sounds good.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:25.080
Is this the place?

00:01:57.040 --> 00:02:01.040
<b>Side Trip Part 1</b>

00:01:58.460 --> 00:01:59.580
Side trip!

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:03.210
Let's go to the top.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.040
Oh?

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:08.630
I wonder what's up there.

00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:10.880
Well, it's gonna be fun to find out.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.170
I'm excited for sure.

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:16.040
By the way, have you ever been here?

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:17.790
Nope. Never.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:18.790
Why?

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:21.670
Cool. It's nothing, I was just curious.

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:31.500
Oh! Then it gets to my favorite part!
You know, where the guy totally blocks the shot!

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:34.750
Ah, that part. Yeah, that was a really cool scene.

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:37.250
After that is great, too! How he gets all injured and stuff!

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:41.750
Personally, I liked the scene where
their eyes meet before the match starts.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:44.500
Totally! That part was awesome, too!

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:48.880
So, Takagi-san. What other manga do you like?

00:02:58.920 --> 00:02:59.960
Takagi-san?

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:01.250
Hey.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:05.250
You're being extra chatty today
for some reason, Nishikata.

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:08.830
Wh-what makes you say that?

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:09.790
I'm just being the usual me!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.380
Maybe you're feeling nervous or something?

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:14.290
Nervous? Why would I be?

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:17.790
I guess it's fine if you're not.

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:20.420
But I was feeling kinda nervous myself.

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:21.790
Just a little.

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:23.750
Why's that?

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:29.630
Whatever. I'm not anymore!

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:36.170
Looks like she hasn't caught on.

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:42.920
My big plan when we reach the top is to ask her:
"How many stairs do you think we just climbed?"

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:44.960
I can't underestimate Takagi-san.

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:48.040
She might know how many steps
are in the school stairwells,

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:50.330
which is why I had us go out of the way to come here.

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:56.830
She just confirmed she's never been here before,
and since I've been talking to her nearly nonstop,

00:03:56.830 --> 00:04:01.250
that should eliminate any chance of
her counting the stairs as we go.

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:04.580
I've got this in the bag.

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.920
Whew! We made it!

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:16.790
Wow. The view is beautiful up here.

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:21.170
Enjoy it while it lasts, Takagi-san!

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:23.750
You have no idea the despair you're about to taste!

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:32.040
Come check it out, Nishikata.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.750
Uh, sure.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:43.960
It looks pretty, huh?

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:56.500
So, did you invite me up here...

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:58.580
just to show me the scenery?

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:02.080
No! I did not!

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:05.040
Sure, whatever you say.

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:08.130
Seriously! I brought you here to have a contest!

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:09.500
Yeah, I figured as much.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:12.460
I mean, you were talking way more than you usually do.

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:15.080
If you knew, then why imply otherwise?!

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:17.250
So, what kind of competition is it?

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:22.880
It has to do with all those stairs we just climbed.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.670
How many steps do you think there were in total?

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.210
415 steps.

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:31.210
Since I'm sure it's impossible for you
to know exactly, I'll give you a handicap.

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:34.000
You win if you can guess correctly within 20...

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:36.630
Huh?

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:38.130
What?

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:40.250
415 steps.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:44.210
WHAT?! HOW?!

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:46.500
How could you know that?!

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:47.920
It's famous, silly.

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:49.790
Famous how...?

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:53.330
Well, since it's 415 steps...

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:56.880
<b>415 =</b>

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:56.880
<b>Sweet Love</b>

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.290
it can almost be read as "sweet love".

00:05:56.830 --> 00:06:00.250
So there's a legend that says boys and girls
who come up here together will start dating.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.460
Wha...?

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.420
You really had no idea, huh?

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:09.380
Well, I wouldn't put it past you
to pick a place like this at random.

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:15.540
C-crap, I never would've come here if I had known that!

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:18.170
I feel like such a huge idiot right now!

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:22.130
By the way, there's a notebook kept
inside of that little shrine there.

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:27.080
And people say if you write down the name
of the person you love, you'll be with them forever.

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:29.670
Uh-huh...

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:33.250
Oh right! You'll have to suffer a penalty since you lost.

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:35.000
So, why don't you write in that book...

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:39.250
Nope, no way. There's no one like that in my life, anyway!

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:42.080
I'm just pulling your leg.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:46.170
Your penalty will be... oh, I know.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.710
You have to bring me here again someday.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:51.380
Since I like the view.

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:53.000
Huh?

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:00.420
Hold on, isn't this place meant for...

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:01.580
What's the problem?

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:05.130
You're not going to start complaining after
you brought me up here yourself, right?

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:08.170
Besides, it's just a legend. Don't tell me you believe it?

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:12.420
As if! Anyway, that's totally not the point!

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:14.670
I mean, legends are, you know...

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:18.750
<b>Side Trip Part 2</b>

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:18.420
Side trip, part 2.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:34.540
He said he wanted to take me somewhere with
a nice view, and I didn't see any reason to say no.

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:40.040
But thinking about it, I'm pretty sure these are the 415
steps of sweet love from the legend people talk about!

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:44.750
Why did he bring me here?
What the heck is going through his head?

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:48.630
Is he really in love with me...?

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:53.170
Wh-what's up?

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:58.170
It's nothing.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.920
Oh god! I'm turning red!

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:03.130
I just wanna go home!

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:10.380
But if I bail on him now, he's gonna think I'm some
kid who believes in fairy tales...

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:19.580
Wow.

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:23.170
The view is nice. You were right about that.

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:33.960
What's the problem?

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:36.880
Hurry up and say something about the 415 stairs legend!

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:39.920
I've been ready and waiting for my chance!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:44.000
You believe in silly stuff like that? What a child.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:46.830
Hojo.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:51.630
So, actually, this place has...

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:52.540
Finally!

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:05.000
...really fresh air.

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:06.380
Huh?!

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:12.210
Nope. A wuss like me never had
the guts to pull this off to begin with.

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:15.250
I'll try again another day.

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.750
Seriously? Look at him breathing in the air like that...

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:24.790
No way! Did we really come here
just to look at the view?!

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:27.790
I was the only one thinking about the legend!

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:30.630
Oh god! I feel like such a child!

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:32.880
Fine then!

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:36.670
Have you heard? There's a legend about this place.

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:38.880
Huh?

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:40.920
Well, you see...

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:55.580
U-uh, I forgot because it was way too childish.

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:01.460
What a beautiful view.

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:03.960
Yeah. Sure is.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:05.790
Really pretty.

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:12.580
<b>Side Trip Part 3</b>

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:10.960
Side trip, part 3!

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:21.500
Okay, Nakai-kun! On the count of three!
Let's climb the stairs together!

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:22.630
Huh?

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:23.960
Wait a second, Nakai-kun!

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:27.170
Jeez, why are you trying to start without me?

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:29.380
Oops, sorry. I just like stairs.

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:30.670
Enough with the jokes!

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:36.170
Don't you get it? These are the life-changing stairs
that are supposed to help couples start dating!

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:37.790
We gotta do it right!

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:40.960
Yeah, but, we're already dating and stuff.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:42.710
That doesn't matter!

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:46.540
Come on, get back here!
We're gonna do it at the same time!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.830
Gosh. This is kinda weird.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:58.080
W-well, I mean, aren't you nervous?

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:01.580
Now that you mention it, I guess so.

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:03.920
Really?

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:07.670
Oh! Check it out.

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:09.920
That rock totally looks like it has a face!

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:16.710
We made it.

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:22.170
Huh? What's up, Mano?

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:29.130
Um... well...

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:31.130
What is it?

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:34.330
I... I want to...

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:39.540
to know if you really... love me.

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:41.330
Yeah, of course I do!

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:43.420
Let's check out the view!

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:48.460
Too casual!

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:49.210
Huh?

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:51.880
You're being way too casual about this!
It's actually making me worried!

00:11:52.380 --> 00:11:55.080
Okay, but I'm not sure what I'm supposed to do different.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:11:59.830
Just forget it.

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:09.830
For the time being, let's just write
each other's names in this notebook.

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:13.000
The legend says that we can be
together forever if we do that.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.710
Nah, I'm good...

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:16.210
BUT WHY?!

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:20.380
I knew it. You must not really love me.

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:21.580
Hold on, you've got it wrong.

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:23.790
Then tell me how I'm supposed to take that!

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:27.250
Shucks... this is embarrassing...

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:31.210
Oh come on! Then just suck it up for me!

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:32.920
What I mean is...

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:39.000
I actually came here before on my own.

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:41.130
So I've already written your name in the notebook.

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:42.580
<b>MANO</b>

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:53.130
Jeez, then why didn't you say something earlier!

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:56.130
You really do love me, don't you, Nakai-kun?

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.250
You got that right.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:04.170
<b>Side Trip Part 4</b>

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:03.420
Side trip, part 4!

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:08.250
Mina... Sanae...

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:11.540
Is this where you wanted to come so badly?

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:12.250
Yep!

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:13.460
Yeah.

00:13:14.130 --> 00:13:17.920
Those two were so desperate to go somewhere
on the way home that I agreed to tag along.

00:13:18.460 --> 00:13:20.880
But I never imagined it would be the famous 415 stairs!

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:23.130
If my guess is right...

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:25.960
Mina and Sanae found someone they like,

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:28.830
but they're too afraid to ask them out
and are stuck admiring them from afar!

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:30.790
So they came to see these legendary stairs of love

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:33.330
that can start relationships in the hopes
of coming with them someday!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:35.500
Yes! That has to be it!

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:39.460
Ah! Finally! These two have started a fire in their hearts!

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:40.330
A fire of love!

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:44.580
Hooray! At long last! We can start
gossiping about love and romance!

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.670
Like the young maidens we are!

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:50.130
So, who stole your hearts? Somebody from our class?

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:52.250
You're gonna tell me everything!

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:54.460
Wha?

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:57.580
Huh?! Wait a second! Get back here!

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:09.670
Yeah!

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:12.330
Nice!

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:16.750
Ugh! Why did you two run up here so fast?

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.170
After we came all this way to enjoy
the stairs of sweet love!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:20.130
Huh?

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:21.000
Street doves?

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:21.920
SWEET LOVE!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.420
What're you talking about?

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.580
Huh?! You haven't heard about it?!

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:29.460
About what?

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.000
Then why did two you want to come here?

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:35.460
The stairs here are really long,
so it's perfect for a training run.

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:39.500
We figured we'd all go up together,
especially since you need more exercise!

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:44.210
I was stupid to get my hopes up.

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:46.880
Well, since we're here...

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:49.500
I can at least sneak a peek at the notebook

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:53.750
that makes your relationship eternal
if you write your lover's name in it.

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:54.460
This one.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:56.880
Look over here, you guys! It's super pretty!

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:06.170
It really is.

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:08.540
How beautiful...

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:11.540
I want to come here someday.

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:13.750
With the man of my dreams.

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:26.630
I was meaning to ask...

00:15:26.630 --> 00:15:28.630
Did you actually come here and count every step?

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:30.630
No. What happened was...

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:33.500
One, two, three, four...

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:36.920
That you, Nishikata?

00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:38.210
Nakai-kun?

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:39.250
Yo!

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:41.080
What're you doing?

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.540
Uh... well...

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:47.210
Just wanted to breath some fresh air!

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:48.250
How about you, dude?

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:48.670
Oh.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:52.130
I was just counting how many steps there are here.

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:54.460
Crap!

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:57.630
I totally forgot how many I had counted so far!

00:15:58.210 --> 00:15:59.500
There's 415 steps.

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:00.290
Huh?

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:02.830
From top to bottom it's 415 steps.

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:04.920
How do you know that?

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:06.130
Uh...

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:08.420
I was counting them for fun, too.

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:11.170
Oh! Awesome! That saves me time!

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.330
Thanks man!

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:15.290
And that's what happened.

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:16.580
Wow.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.790
Mano-chan's so lucky.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:19.960
Huh?

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:21.790
What does that mean?

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.130
I'm not telling!

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:26.630
Huh? Why not?

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:28.580
Come on, just tell me!

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:30.130
I'm not telling!

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.460
Takagi-san!

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:36.580
<b>Renting DVDs</b>

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.830
Renting DVDs!

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:42.960
I just remembered there's a book I want to buy.

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:44.790
Can you wait for me?

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:46.080
Sure.

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:58.880
<b>100% Unrequited Love</b>

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:58.880
<b>THE MOVIE!</b>

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:58.880
<b>All the latest news!!</b>

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:03.750
Not too much longer until
100% Unrequited Love The Movie comes out!

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:08.830
<b>SPECIAL GIFT FOR COUPLES!!</b>

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:08.830
<b>Find out what it is after</b>

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:08.830
<b>you see the movie!</b>

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:08.830
<b>December</b>

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:08.830
<b>24 & 25 ONLY!</b>

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:11.290
A special gift for couples?!

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:14.920
Oh man, I want it! I totally want whatever it is!

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:19.130
But... I don't have anyone to go with.

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:25.750
No, I can't let Kimura and the other guys know
that I'm a fan of 100% UL.

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:28.080
Plus, we wouldn't count as a couple anyway.

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:33.920
No freaking way! I could never
overcome the humiliation of that!

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:36.330
Besides, we are totally NOT a couple!

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:39.380
<b>Gunman of the Prairie 2</b>

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:42.000
Gunman of the Prairie 2!

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:43.880
You're a big fan of Westerns, huh?

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:46.750
Yeah, I love 'em!

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.630
<b>Gunman of</b>

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.630
<b>the Prairie 2</b>

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:50.580
They're all out of stock!

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:51.330
Bummer.

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:52.920
That's too bad.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.290
I really wanted to see it...

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:58.210
Guess I'll find something else to rent.

00:17:58.420 --> 00:17:59.790
Oh, I've got a idea!

00:17:59.790 --> 00:18:03.210
Let's both find a good movie to rent
and then swap with each other!

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:05.830
Sounds fun. Let's do it.

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:08.790
Okay, I'm off to look for one!

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:12.630
<b>Horror Genre</b>

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:17.540
I'm gonna pick something that'll scare the crap outta her.

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:21.080
Eek! Zombies!

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:23.460
It's my revenge for what happened at Culture Fest!

00:18:23.960 --> 00:18:25.920
Let's see what we've got.

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.500
This one looks good.

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.250
<b>Zombie Uprising</b>

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:29.420
<b>Titan Terror</b>

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.040
So does this one.

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:46.630
I'll look for something I actually suggest instead.

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:47.460
<b>Horror Genre</b>

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:50.750
Seems like you made up your mind.

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:51.420
Yep!

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:54.130
I think that you should watch... this one!

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:54.130
<b>Duel of</b>

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:54.130
<b>the Planets</b>

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.500
I knew you'd pick a Western!

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.830
No, you're wrong. This one is different!

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:00.790
Oh?

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.460
What kind of movie is it, then?

00:19:02.460 --> 00:19:06.460
<b>Duel of</b>

00:19:02.460 --> 00:19:06.460
<b>the Planets</b>

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:06.460
It makes you think it's going to be a Western,
but it actually takes place in the future.

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:10.880
Earth is on the verge of war with an alien species.

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:14.880
<b>We wish to avoid</b>

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:14.880
<b>unnecessary bloodshed.</b>

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.880
But the aliens want to settle things
with as little violence as possible.

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:18.830
So they propose having a traditional 1-on-1 duel
where each side puts forth a single fighter,

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:21.330
and the main character gets picked to represent Earth!

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:21.130
I'll take you down with me.

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:20.830
<b>I'll take you</b>

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:20.830
<b>down with me.</b>

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:24.080
Wow. That sounds exciting!

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:24.630
Right?

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.670
And the ending throws a huge twist at you!

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:30.170
It turns out that the main character
was an alien the whole time!

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:32.880
What? Did you just spoil it for me?

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:34.830
<b>Duel of</b>

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:34.830
<b>the Planets</b>

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:34.210
Huh?

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:41.170
I'm sorry, I got too excited.
I'll go find something else for you.

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:42.830
That's okay.

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:44.500
I'll watch it.

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:47.000
But... I mean...

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:50.630
<b>Duel of</b>

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:50.630
<b>the Planets</b>

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:50.630
You went to the trouble of picking
this out just for me, after all.

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:53.330
Okay then.

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:55.540
Great. Then it's my turn now!

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:56.540
Here!

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:59.000
<b>My Brand New Morning</b>

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:59.000
"My Brand New Morning"!

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:01.330
Some kind of drama?

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:03.210
Yeah, but that's not all.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:08.080
It has battles and stuff too,
so I figured that you might enjoy it.

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:10.290
Oh? What kind of story is it?

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:15.670
The main character is a fugitive on the run and
has to fight against a bunch of bounty hunters,

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:19.080
all while trying to reach an old friend
of his who's dying from an illness.

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:20.960
Whoa! That sounds great!

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:22.920
There's even a scene with a duel.

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:25.960
Awesome! Sounds like I'm gonna love it!

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:31.080
But that only makes me feel worse
about spoiling you, I'm real sorry...

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:34.330
You don't have to worry about it, honestly!

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:37.920
How about this, Nishikata?

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:40.790
If you want to make it up to me...

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:46.790
Takagi-san?

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:51.420
Let's both pick one more movie to trade with each other.

00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:58.130
Catch you later, Nishikata.

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:00.630
See ya!

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:15.380
Whenever a good opportunity arises...
I just never have enough courage.

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:25.250
Wow... what a great movie. "My Brand New Morning".

00:21:26.170 --> 00:21:30.000
Next time I go rent a movie,
I'll ask Takagi-san for some suggestions.

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:33.380
Oh, that's right. She gave me another one.

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:34.380
Let's see...

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:42.540
Takagi-san?

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:44.500
<b>Takagi-san</b>

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:44.500
<b>Check out the big news I found!</b>

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:47.670
<b>Special Gift for Couples!!</b>

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:47.670
<b>Only on Christmas</b>

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:48.540
Wait, is she saying...?

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:51.380
<b>How</b>

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:51.380
<b>about it?</b>

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:55.460
<b>I would appreciate it if you'd go with me.</b>

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:58.330
<b>I would appreciate it</b>

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:58.330
<b>if you'd go with me.</b>

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:04.000
<b>Let's Watch It Together</b>

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:06.330
She knew I wanted to go...

00:22:06.540 --> 00:22:07.880
Curse you, Takagi-san.
